#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:65 fdf2b92d805c4291adae52c669e48257
msgid ""
"The scintillator `layer` and MRPC `module` share the same axis, and the "
"`phi` and `strip` fields also share the same axis."
msgstr "闪烁体的 `layer` 与 MRPC 的 `module` 共用同一坐标轴，`phi` 与 `strip` 字段也共用同一坐标轴。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:68 f0119c049e1c4115a58617755f4f1a36
