msgstr "获取完整的 strip 位置表："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:153 99bb58674fd0452abadd0cf3569c8645
msgid "Hit status"
msgstr "hit 状态字"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:155 b242f9d2dc654ae9b657ced10eaf33f8
msgid ""
"The hit status of a TOF hit encodes which part of the TOF the hit belongs"
" to, its layer, and several flags and counters of the hit. It can be "
"parsed into individual fields, and it can also be combined with the "
"`tofID` of the hit to get the `gid` of the hit strip."
msgstr ""
"TOF hit 的状态字编码了该 hit 属于 TOF 的哪一部分、所在层，以及若干标志位与计数器。它既可以被解析成各个字段，也可以与 hit 的"
" `tofID` 结合得到该 strip 的 `gid`。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:159 79cacdfdcc5f43ffad8309c5b45d1eaf
msgid "Fields"
msgstr "字段"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:161 84b999a2ecf44cedbaae741c51d09955
msgid ""
"Pybes3 provides implementation of `TofHitStatus` functions. They are "
"defined as `tof_hit_status_to_*`. All these functions are backed by "
"compiled NumPy ufuncs. The calling convention is identical for scalar, "
"NumPy array, and Awkward Array inputs:"
msgstr ""
"Pybes3 提供了 `TofHitStatus` 各函数的实现，命名统一为 `tof_hit_status_to_*`。这些函数都由编译好的 "
"NumPy ufunc 实现，标量、NumPy 数组与 Awkward Array 三种输入的调用方式完全一致："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:238 1484752b6ff049b09baecc9af8279857
msgid "Use `parse_tof_hit_status` to parse all fields from a hit status at once:"
msgstr "用 `parse_tof_hit_status` 一次性解析状态字的所有字段："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:257 99439bdfa3da4b65b37d08907ea5c1f6
msgid "Strip gid"
msgstr "strip 的 gid"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:259 55ea8862d20d42c3b3c2821605cbace2
msgid ""
"`tof_hit_status_id_to_gid` converts the hit status and the `tofID` of a "
"TOF hit into the `gid` of the strip which was hit:"
msgstr "`tof_hit_status_id_to_gid` 把 TOF hit 的状态字与其 `tofID` 转换成被击中 strip 的 `gid`："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:274 54328897e7a8492d9add45f956a63643
msgid ""
"The `tofID` is not the raw digi ID, but a compact index which enumerates "
"the counters of the part of the TOF the hit belongs to. The two endcaps "
"of a sub-detector share a single index space, the east one first, and the"
" hit status tells which sub-detector it is:"
msgstr ""
"`tofID` 不是原始 digi ID，而是一个紧凑索引，按该 hit 所属 TOF "
"部位的各计数器顺序编号。子探测器的两个端盖共用一个索引空间（东端盖在前），由状态字指明它属于哪个子探测器："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 6a86ebe45a904cf49c93bcce1f54b31a
msgid "Part"
msgstr "部位"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 5f2e7f47ea0143f4aee63036b2ec790c
#: fb9b05ef068e4b1cb22b651ff6c79e3f
msgid "`tofID`"
msgstr "`tofID`"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 5e0c8dc6f14b443d8664f980d62120cf
msgid "`gid`"
msgstr "`gid`"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 38192283cae6413c87fcd5b1f11ea97d
msgid "Barrel"
msgstr "桶部"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 c89f3a7b21894fc6abc3ef629e532ecb
msgid "`layer * 88 + phi`"
msgstr "`layer * 88 + phi`"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 af259aafd6fc40d8b6a940a1822634ef
msgid "`48 + tofID`"
msgstr "`48 + tofID`"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 771ad757b9e740cf99f84ae39cbd5873
msgid "Scintillator east endcap"
msgstr "闪烁体东端盖"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 3426a85ccc9349999ec7e84bca9eedac
msgid "`phi`"
msgstr "`phi`"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 88a0df4705f0447bb6a8129e00e9874b
msgid "Scintillator west endcap"
msgstr "闪烁体西端盖"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 4943d92133404ee9ab5b114714524bb8
msgid "`48 + phi`"
msgstr "`48 + phi`"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 e764995018894a46b321be3d9fb9c2fa
msgid "`tofID + 176`"
msgstr "`tofID + 176`"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 83c99157e437445cb2907d57df650814
msgid "MRPC east endcap"
msgstr "MRPC 东端盖"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 be34f4d142534f92934d3a76e57501aa
msgid "`module * 12 + strip`"
msgstr "`module * 12 + strip`"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 320d19dbb0e7479fbac545138ddc54b9
#: 89a3db9de7ad463895c007f71f3bbe06
msgid "`272 + tofID`"
msgstr "`272 + tofID`"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 7a33e8f42cde41eea4b94adc62bdf09f
msgid "MRPC west endcap"
msgstr "MRPC 西端盖"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 81f799cbdc5e4ef78cd423aa6481aed3
msgid "`432 + module * 12 + strip`"
msgstr "`432 + module * 12 + strip`"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:287 5c8a4b03890548b79764f996d5bd11dc
msgid ""
"A hit without a hit status (`status == 0`) stores the raw digi ID in "
"`m_tofID` instead of the compact index above, and a negative `m_tofID` is"
" not a valid counter index. Both are rejected with a `ValueError`, so "
"filter them out before calling the function."
msgstr ""
"没有状态字（`status == 0`）的 hit 会在 `m_tofID` 中存放原始 digi ID而不是上面的紧凑索引，负的 "
"`m_tofID` 也不是有效的计数器索引。这两种情况都会抛出 `ValueError`，请在调用前先过滤掉。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:292 23b1a2a30a604ae8afb8d1a356c6462a
msgid "Raw data conversion"
msgstr "原始数据转换"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:294 23e04549d99140bebe8f4cbee4400caa
msgid ""
"The ADC and the TDC channel numbers of a hit can be converted into charge"
" and time with `tof_adc_to_charge` and `tof_tdc_to_time`:"
msgstr "hit 的 ADC 与 TDC 道数可用 `tof_adc_to_charge` 与 `tof_tdc_to_time` 分别转换为电荷与时间："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:308 192cbfa2824f406b90c7617cc676fb6b
msgid ""
"The charge is calculated as `charge = (adc & 0x1fff) * 0.3`, i.e. only "
"the lower 13 bits of the ADC word carry the charge channel number, and "
"the conversion formula of the time is:"
msgstr "电荷按 `charge = (adc & 0x1fff) * 0.3` 计算，即只有 ADC 字的低 13 位携带电荷道数；时间的换算公式为："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:312 b748ad3a6c1147fc9abbb44f3d1a6890
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\text{time} = \\text{tdc} \\times \\frac{12000}{499.8 \\times 8 \\times "
"1024}~\\mathrm{ns}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\text{time} = \\text{tdc} \\times \\frac{12000}{499.8 \\times 8 \\times "
"1024}~\\mathrm{ns}\n"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:316 11cf2d9bfd2b4cbebd16b462361a33fc
msgid "Same as BOSS"
msgstr "与 BOSS 一致"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:319 1eb426a8650746029e498c772f22753b
msgid ""
"TOF charge and time calculations are the same as the ones given by "
"`RawDataUtil::TofCharge` and `RawDataUtil::TofTime` in `BOSS`."
msgstr ""
"TOF 的电荷与时间计算与 `BOSS` 中 `RawDataUtil::TofCharge` 和 `RawDataUtil::TofTime` "
"给出的结果一致。"

